Title: "Given"
Id: "582cdb18-d663-450e-8070-86978aa879b6"

Text: "Nested `given:` clauses introduce assumptions for a local `then:` block.

```mlg-fragment
given: f is \\(injective)::function
then: f is? \\function
```

The `given:` section accepts refined-capable declaration statements. Optional `where:` clauses may add local assumptions before `then:` is checked."
Id: "e19dcb81-f75d-4473-9d96-892a09941200"
